{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been framed.</strong> <br><strong>Now, there\u2019s no turning back.</strong> <br>As an agent of the secret special forces A.A.U., you were dispatched to Serbia on a covert mission. But as you carried out your assignment, you were intercepted. <br>Unfortunately, you now find yourself deep within the abandoned territory of the former Yugoslav town of Uzovnica. With no way back, you\u2019ll have to fight your way out.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/f0c8e4871530aee4d8d14e495cc788f4.poster.avif?t=1757670887\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/f0c8e4871530aee4d8d14e495cc788f4.webm?t=1757670887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/f0c8e4871530aee4d8d14e495cc788f4.mp4?t=1757670887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This atmospheric FPS combines realistic visuals, found-footage aesthetics designed to deliver an immersive journey through six  scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The initial release includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-God\u2019s Chosen (a Demon) (<i>Available at launch</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Guilt Trip (<i>Available at launch</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Future scenes will be released over the coming months:</strong><br><br>-Beneath the Rotten Sky\u00a0(<i>Coming soon</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Clean Cut</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Together They Fall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Absolution denied</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607440?t=175767088